        <dl class="dl-horizontal">

            <dt>Concept UI</dt><dd>M0018002</dd>

            
                <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>A discipline concerned with relations between messages and the characteristics of individuals who select and interpret them; it deals directly with the processes of encoding (phonetics) and decoding (psychoacoustics) as they relate states of messages to states of communicators.</dd>
            

